  <p>While lightweight fabrics are popular for low-impact yoga, premium fitness brands are increasingly turning to <strong>heavyweight fabrics (280GSM - 300GSM)</strong> for their core collections. At FITCLO, our 290GSM Nylon/Spandex blend has become a bestseller for brands prioritizing luxury feel, total opacity, and structural integrity.</p>

