  <h2>Technical Specifications: 85% Nylon / 15% Spandex</h2>
  <p>This specific <strong>85/15 ratio</strong> in a <strong>290GSM</strong> weight offers a unique combination of performance and comfort. Unlike lighter fabrics, this heavyweight Interlock knit provides a "thick" hand-feel that feels substantial and premium to the touch.</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>100% Squat-Proof:</strong> Even in lighter colors, the 290GSM density ensures zero transparency during deep lunges or squats.</li>
    <li><strong>Maximum Sculpting:</strong> The higher spandex content paired with heavy weight creates a "body-shaping" effect, providing the compression and support that high-end customers demand.</li>
    <li><strong>Soft Matte Finish:</strong> The nylon-rich blend offers a sophisticated matte appearance, avoiding the "plastic" sheen found in cheaper polyester alternatives.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>70+ Colors Ready for Production</h2>
  <p>As shown in our 2026 color chart, we maintain a massive library of ready-to-dye and pre-dyed options for this 290GSM series. From vibrant neons for summer launches to sophisticated muted earth tones for autumn collections, we can match your brand's specific palette with <strong>Pantone accuracy</strong>.</p>

  <p>For brands looking to position themselves in the luxury "Athleisure" segment, choosing a 290GSM fabric is the most effective way to communicate quality to your customers before they even try the garment on.</p>

